How can I use C# to calculate the total cost of a meal with varying ingredient quantities and costs? For example, if I have the following ingredients and costs:
Lettuce (3 oz): $1.50;
Tomatoes (2 pcs): $0.50;
Onion (1 pc): $0.20;
Garlic (2 cloves): $0.05
